@@@!atrep-exo
@=at-markdown=>html

@@/ HTML rendering of at-markdown's own sims. Everything shared
@@/ with at-html (elements, escape table) is inherited through
@@/ the lineage from at-html.html.exo; this overlay covers only
@@/ the footnote extension, which at-html does not define. The
@@/ shape follows litogramma.html.exo: a superscript link for
@@/ the callout, an aside for the body.

@-> *deixis ^
<sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#@(onym)">&#8224;</a></sup>
>-@

@-> ^
<aside class="footnote"@[ id="@(onym)"]@>
@(grammata)
</aside>
>-@
